<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Daniil Ladyka – CV</title>
  <meta name="description" content="CV website for Daniil Ladyka – Cook / Kitchen Operations" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0d0f13; --panel:#11151b; --card:#151a21; --muted:#9aa3af; --text:#e9eef5; --accent:#6ee7b7; --accent-2:#60a5fa; --chip:#1f2937;
    }
    html,body{margin:0; font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Noto Sans", "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji"; color:var(--text); background:radial-gradient(1200px 800px at 10% -10%, #152033 0%, #0d0f13 60%);}
    .container{max-width:980px; margin:32px auto; padding:24px;}
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0)); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:20px; box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);}
    header.card{display:flex; gap:24px; padding:28px; align-items:flex-start;}
    .avatar{width:84px; height:84px; border-radius:18px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2)); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:28px; font-weight:800; color:#0b1020;}
    h1{font-size:32px; margin:0 0 6px 0; letter-spacing:0.2px;}
    .role{font-weight:600; color:#c7d2fe;}
    .meta{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-top:12px;}
    .chip{background:var(--chip); color:#cbd5e1; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding:8px 10px; border-radius:999px; font-size:13px;}
    .grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap:24px; margin-top:24px;}
    @media (max-width: 860px){ .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} header.card{flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start;} .avatar{width:72px;height:72px;} }
    section.card{padding:24px;}
    section h2{font-size:20px; margin:0 0 14px 0; letter-spacing:0.2px;}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);}
    .row{display:flex; gap:18px;}
    .row .right{margin-left:auto; text-align:right; color:#cbd5e1; font-size:13px;}
    .item{padding:16px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius:16px; background:var(--card); margin-bottom:12px;}
    .item h3{margin:0 0 6px 0; font-size:16px;}
    .item p{margin:6px 0; color:#dbe4ee;}
    ul{margin:8px 0 0 18px;}
    li{margin:6px 0;}
    .toolbar{display:flex; gap:10px; margin:16px 0 8px;}
    button{appearance:none; border:none; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-2), var(--accent)); color:#08111f; font-weight:700; padding:10px 14px; border-radius:12px; cursor:pointer; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);}    
    button.secondary{background:#1f2937; color:#d1d5db; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);}
    a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
    footer{margin:18px 0; text-align:center; color:#94a3b8; font-size:12px;}
    .cols{display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); gap:10px;}
    @media (max-width:600px){ .cols{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
    .kbd{font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace; font-size:12px; background:#0b1220; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding:2px 6px; border-radius:6px;}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="card" role="banner">
      <div class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">DL</div>
      <div>
        <h1>Daniil Ladyka</h1>
        <div class="role">Cook • Kitchen Operations</div>
        <div class="meta">
          <div class="chip">Based in Flisa, Norway</div>
          <div class="chip">4 years in professional kitchens</div>
          <div class="chip">Italian & Japanese cuisine</div>
        </div>
        <div class="toolbar">
          <button onclick="window.print()" title="Print or Save as PDF">Print / Save as PDF</button>
          <a class="secondary" href="#contact"><button class="secondary" title="Jump to contact">Contact</button></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="grid">
      <main>
        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="about">
          <h2 id="about">Profile</h2>
          <p class="muted">Motivated cook seeking to join <strong>General Foodstuff</strong> in Grimetown. I regularly have lunch at your restaurant and appreciate the quality of the food and the team’s standards. I’m eager to contribute, learn, and cook alongside your chefs.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="experience">
          <h2 id="experience">Experience</h2>

          <div class="item">
            <div class="row">
              <h3 class="left">Head Cook – Puzata Hata</h3>
              <div class="right">Ukraine</div>
            </div>
            <p>Led kitchen operations and supervised staff to ensure quality and consistency.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Oversaw end-to-end kitchen processes and daily service.</li>
              <li>Coordinated the team and addressed issues proactively.</li>
              <li>Maintained high hygiene and food safety standards.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="item">
            <div class="row">
              <h3 class="left">Cook – Yaposhka (Japanese Cuisine)</h3>
              <div class="right">Ukraine</div>
            </div>
            <p>Prepared sushi, rolls, and a variety of Japanese dishes in a fast-paced environment.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Executed mise en place and precise knife work for sushi preparation.</li>
              <li>Collaborated with chefs to deliver consistent flavors and presentation.</li>
              <li>Supported inventory rotation and workstation organization.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="skills">
          <h2 id="skills">Skills</h2>
          <div class="cols">
            <ul>
              <li>Hot & cold line cooking</li>
              <li>Sushi & rolls preparation</li>
              <li>Kitchen process control</li>
            </ul>
            <ul>
              <li>Team coordination & communication</li>
              <li>Food safety & hygiene</li>
              <li>Menu prep & mise en place</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="motivation">
          <h2 id="motivation">Motivation</h2>
          <p>I enjoy Italian and Japanese cuisine, and I’ve traveled to those countries, which deepened my understanding of their food culture. I’m excited to bring this passion to your kitchen.</p>
        </section>
      </main>

      <aside>
        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="contact" id="contact">
          <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
          <div class="item">
            <div class="row"><strong>Address</strong><div class="right">Updated: 5 September 2025</div></div>
            <p>Gamle Knappumsveg 1<br />2270 Flisa, Norway</p>
          </div>
          <div class="item">
            <p><strong>Phone</strong><br /><span class="muted">+47 000 00 000</span></p>
            <p><strong>Email</strong><br /><span class="muted">firstname.lastname@example.com</span></p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="objective">
          <h2 id="objective">Objective</h2>
          <p>Join <strong>General Foodstuff</strong> (Greasy Street 24, 6342 Grimetown) as a cook and contribute to a welcoming guest experience and excellent food quality.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="extras">
          <h2 id="extras">Highlights</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>4 years of experience in professional kitchens</li>
            <li>Hands-on leadership as a Head Cook</li>
            <li>Strong interest in Italian & Japanese cuisine</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <footer>
      © <span id="year"></span> Daniil Ladyka – CV website. Press <span class="kbd">Ctrl/Cmd + P</span> to save as PDF.
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>

  <style media="print">
    body{background:#fff; color:#000;}
    .card{box-shadow:none; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;}
    .toolbar{display:none !important;}
  </style>
</body>
</html>
